                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the highest-ROI healthcare AI application?</h3>
                                        <p>Ambient documentation. Physicians save 60-90 min/day. Payback within 3-6 months for most hospitals.</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need FDA clearance for a healthcare AI app?</h3>
                                        <p>Only for diagnostic / therapeutic AI (SaMD). Documentation, RCM, ops AI generally don't need SaMD clearance.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I use GPT-4 with PHI?</h3>
                                        <p>Only with proper HIPAA / DPDP / PDPL controls — BAA in place, private endpoints, no data retention. Anthropic, OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Google Vertex all support this.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does regulated clinical AI take to launch?</h3>
                                        <p>12-30 months for FDA / CDSCO / MHRA clearance on diagnostic AI. Non-regulated AI: 3-9 months.</p>
